<title>USA: Lasermedics Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Lasermedics Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SUGAR LAND, Texas 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lasermedics, Inc.</p>
<p>			     Third Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				   September 30,     September 30,</p>
<p>			     1996	 1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net sales	 $5,228,426*   $257,126 $8,093,719   $384,664</p>
<p> Cost of sales     2,341,731    157,590  3,755,479    222,051</p>
<p> Gross profit	2,886,695     99,536  4,338,240    162,613</p>
<p>Operating expenses</p>
<p>			 2,334,088    334,169  4,413,794  1,292,515</p>
<p>Income (loss) from</p>
<p>  operations	   552,607  (234,634)   (75,554)(1,129,902)</p>
<p>Net income (loss)    301,084  (263,303)  (661,781) (1,172,913)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per</p>
<p>  common share	    0.12     (0.18)     (0.36)     (0.82)</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 2,412,827  1,457,990  1,823,288  1,435,033</p>
<p>* NOTE: LMDX acquired Henley Healthcare on April 30, 1996, which added significantly to the company's revenues.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
